 "Cookie Policy": "",
 "Last updated: March 18, 2026": "",
 "This Cookies Policy explains what cookies are and how we use them on our website. You should read this policy so you can understand what types of cookies we use, what information we collect through cookies, and how that information is used.": "",
 "Cookies do not typically contain any information that personally identifies you, but personal information that we store about you may be linked to the information obtained from cookies. For further details about how we process and protect your personal data, please refer to our Privacy Policy.": "",
 "We do not store sensitive personal information, such as mailing addresses or account passwords, in the cookies we use.": "",
 "Interpretation and Definitions": "",
 "For the purposes of this Cookies Policy:": "",
 "<strong>Company</strong> (referred to as “The Breathwork Way”, “we”, “us” or “our”) refers to The Breathwork Way.": "",
 "<strong>Cookies</strong> means small text files placed on your computer, mobile device, or other device by a website, containing details of your browsing activity among other uses.": "",
 "<strong>Website</strong> refers to The Breathwork Way, accessible at www.thebreathworkway.com.": "",
 "<strong>You</strong> means the individual accessing or using the Website.": "",
 "How We Use Cookies": "",
 "We use both <strong>session cookies</strong> (which are deleted when you close your browser) and <strong>persistent cookies</strong> (which remain until deleted) for the purposes described below.": "",
 "<strong>Necessary / Essential Cookies</strong>": "",
 "Type: Session cookies": "",
 "Administered by: Us": "",
 "Purpose: These cookies are essential to provide you with the services available through our website and to enable basic site functionality, such as remembering your cookie preferences and ensuring the site operates correctly.": "",
 "<strong>Functionality Cookies</strong>": "",
 "Type: Persistent cookies": "",
 "Purpose: These cookies allow us to remember your preferences and improve your experience, for example remembering your preferred language so you do not have to re-enter your choices each time you visit.": "",
 "<strong>Analytics and Performance Cookies</strong>": "",
 "Administered by: Third party services": "",
 "Purpose: These cookies help us understand how visitors use our website, for example which pages are most popular or how users navigate the site, so we can improve functionality and content. Third party services including Google Analytics and site optimisation tools may also set cookies on your device. These third parties have their own privacy policies governing how they use such information.": "",
 "Your Choices Regarding Cookies": "",
 "If you prefer to avoid the use of cookies on the website, you can disable them in your browser settings and delete any cookies already stored. Please note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality and user experience of the website.": "",
 "You can find instructions for managing cookies in the following popular browsers:": "",
 "Google Chrome": "",
 "Mozilla Firefox": "",
 "Safari": "",
 "Microsoft Edge": "",
